("p", "**Which chain is longer?** A chain with 5 steps is rare because the energy at the fifth level would be 0.01 per cent of the producers' energy."),
("p", "**Why is DDT in human milk higher than in grass?** Biological magnification: humans are at the top of the chain so the poison concentrates."),
